{
  "case_id" : "CAS-00002",
  "justification" : "C1059 received 48000.00 CAD by wire (TX-00454, 2026-09-16, from EXT-2224) and sent 45500.00 CAD by wire (TX-00496, 2026-09-16, to EXT-2137), about five hours later. The account has only these two transactions and no evident business purpose, and about 95% of the funds moved on within the same day. Both legs are domestic (CA). No legitimate explanation appears in the account data. These are reasonable grounds to suspect a pass-through used to layer funds."
